<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Memories"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Within Temptation"/><amll:meta key="album" value="The Howling"/><amll:meta key="album" value="The Silent Force"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="DEC760400310"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="4424930"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1553280570"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="42886855"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="ArSrNa"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>Sharon den Adel</songwriter><songwriter>Robert Westerholt</songwriter><songwriter>Martijn Spierenburg</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:28.004"><div begin="35.919" end="3:28.004"><p begin="35.919" end="39.408" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.919" end="36.229">In</span> <span begin="36.229" end="36.578">this</span> <span begin="36.578" end="37.277">world</span> <span begin="37.277" end="37.866">you</span> <span begin="37.866" end="39.408">tried</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在这个世界上 你正尝试着</span></p><p begin="40.232" end="45.552" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.232" end="40.578">Not</span> <span begin="40.578" end="40.885">lea</span><span begin="40.885" end="41.268">ving</span> <span begin="41.268" end="41.584">me</span> <span begin="41.584" end="41.947">a</span> <span begin="41.947" end="42.525">lone</span><span begin="42.525" end="43.204">ly</span> <span begin="43.204" end="45.552">heart</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">不让我孤单一人</span></p><p begin="46.563" end="50.716" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.563" end="46.779">There&apos;s</span> <span begin="46.779" end="47.189">no</span> <span begin="47.189" end="48.518">other</span> <span begin="48.518" end="50.716">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但没有其他办法</span></p><p begin="50.716" end="54.327" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.716" end="51.056">I</span> <span begin="51.056" end="51.403">prayed</span> <span begin="51.403" end="51.743">to</span> <span begin="51.743" end="52.066">the</span> <span begin="52.066" end="52.656">gods</span> <span begin="52.656" end="52.960">let</span> <span begin="52.960" end="53.322">him</span> <span begin="53.322" end="54.327">stay</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我向上苍祈求 让他留下</span></p><p begin="57.360" end="1:02.302" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.360" end="57.711">The</span> <span begin="57.711" end="58.032">me</span><span begin="58.032" end="58.371">mo</span><span begin="58.371" end="58.689">ries</span> <span begin="58.689" end="59.270">ease</span> <span begin="59.270" end="1:00.011">the</span> <span begin="1:00.011" end="1:00.624">pain</span> <span begin="1:00.624" end="1:01.236">in</span><span begin="1:01.236" end="1:02.302">side</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">回忆能缓解我内心深处的痛苦</span></p><p begin="1:02.987" end="1:08.274" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.987" end="1:03.338">Now</span> <span begin="1:03.338" end="1:03.675">I</span> <span begin="1:03.675" end="1:03.999">know</span> <span begin="1:03.999" end="1:08.274">why</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">现在我才明白 这是为什么</span></p><p begin="1:08.274" end="1:12.911" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.274" end="1:08.573">All</span> <span begin="1:08.573" end="1:08.928">of</span> <span begin="1:08.928" end="1:09.617">my</span> <span begin="1:09.617" end="1:09.856">me</span><span begin="1:09.856" end="1:10.243">mo</span><span begin="1:10.243" end="1:10.860">ries</span> <span begin="1:10.860" end="1:11.531">keep</span> <span begin="1:11.531" end="1:12.206">you</span> <span begin="1:12.206" end="1:12.911">near</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我所有的回忆 让你我更加靠近</span></p><p begin="1:13.255" end="1:18.492" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.255" end="1:13.629">In</span> <span begin="1:13.629" end="1:14.183">si</span><span begin="1:14.183" end="1:14.505">lent</span> <span begin="1:14.505" end="1:15.140">mo</span><span begin="1:15.140" end="1:15.882">ments</span> <span begin="1:16.105" end="1:16.498">ima</span><span begin="1:16.498" end="1:16.861">gine</span> <span begin="1:16.861" end="1:17.192">you</span> <span begin="1:17.192" end="1:17.799">near</span> <span begin="1:17.799" end="1:18.492">here</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在寂静时刻 幻想你就在我身边</span></p><p begin="1:18.858" end="1:23.458" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.858" end="1:19.134">All</span> <span begin="1:19.134" end="1:19.479">of</span> <span begin="1:19.479" end="1:20.090">my</span> <span begin="1:20.090" end="1:20.443">me</span><span begin="1:20.443" end="1:20.764">mo</span><span begin="1:20.764" end="1:21.458">ries</span> <span begin="1:21.458" end="1:22.117">keep</span> <span begin="1:22.117" end="1:22.779">you</span> <span begin="1:22.779" end="1:23.458">near</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我所有的回忆 让你我更加靠近</span></p><p begin="1:23.740" end="1:31.274" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:23.740" end="1:24.071">Your</span> <span begin="1:24.071" end="1:24.741">si</span><span begin="1:24.741" end="1:25.068">lent</span> <span begin="1:25.068" end="1:25.698">whis</span><span begin="1:25.698" end="1:26.380">pers,</span> <span begin="1:26.773" end="1:27.368">si</span><span begin="1:27.368" end="1:27.707">lent</span> <span begin="1:27.707" end="1:31.274">tears</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你轻声的低语 沉默的眼泪</span></p><p begin="1:34.037" end="1:37.665" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.037" end="1:34.278">Made</span> <span begin="1:34.278" end="1:34.633">me</span> <span begin="1:34.633" end="1:35.259">promise</span> <span begin="1:35.259" end="1:35.888">I&apos;d</span> <span begin="1:35.888" end="1:37.665">try</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">给我一次承诺的机会 我会尽力</span></p><p begin="1:38.283" end="1:43.834" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:38.283" end="1:38.608">To</span> <span begin="1:38.608" end="1:38.942">find</span> <span begin="1:38.942" end="1:39.308">my</span> <span begin="1:39.308" end="1:39.588">way</span> <span begin="1:39.588" end="1:39.982">back</span> <span begin="1:40.256" end="1:40.555">in</span> <span begin="1:40.555" end="1:40.880">this</span> <span begin="1:40.880" end="1:43.834">life</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">去寻找回到今生的路</span></p><p begin="1:44.400" end="1:48.534" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:44.400" end="1:44.550">I</span> <span begin="1:44.550" end="1:44.890">hope</span> <span begin="1:44.890" end="1:45.248">there</span> <span begin="1:45.248" end="1:45.846">is</span> <span begin="1:45.846" end="1:46.518">a</span> <span begin="1:46.518" end="1:48.534">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我希望会有办法</span></p><p begin="1:48.814" end="1:52.503" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:48.814" end="1:49.159">To</span> <span begin="1:49.159" end="1:49.464">give</span> <span begin="1:49.464" end="1:49.813">me</span> <span begin="1:49.813" end="1:50.123">a</span> <span begin="1:50.123" end="1:50.719">sign</span> <span begin="1:50.719" end="1:51.082">you&apos;re</span> <span begin="1:51.082" end="1:52.503">ok</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">能让我得知你仍安好</span></p><p begin="1:55.419" end="2:00.377" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:55.419" end="1:55.770">Re</span><span begin="1:55.770" end="1:56.056">minds</span> <span begin="1:56.056" end="1:56.377">me</span> <span begin="1:56.377" end="1:57.316">again</span> <span begin="1:57.316" end="1:58.003">it&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:58.003" end="1:58.670">worth</span> <span begin="1:58.670" end="1:59.279">it</span> <span begin="1:59.279" end="2:00.377">all</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">再次提醒我 这一切都值得</span></p><p begin="2:00.819" end="2:06.307" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:00.819" end="2:00.966">So</span> <span begin="2:00.966" end="2:01.316">I</span> <span begin="2:01.316" end="2:01.659">can</span> <span begin="2:01.659" end="2:01.967">go</span> <span begin="2:01.967" end="2:06.307">on</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所以我会坚持下去</span></p><p begin="2:06.307" end="2:10.942" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:06.307" end="2:06.585">All</span> <span begin="2:06.585" end="2:06.898">of</span> <span begin="2:06.898" end="2:07.553">my</span> <span begin="2:07.553" end="2:07.847">me</span><span begin="2:07.847" end="2:08.178">mo</span><span begin="2:08.178" end="2:08.873">ries</span> <span begin="2:08.873" end="2:09.566">keep</span> <span begin="2:09.566" end="2:10.234">you</span> <span begin="2:10.234" end="2:10.942">near</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我所有的回忆 让你我更加靠近</span></p><p begin="2:11.233" end="2:16.397" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:11.233" end="2:11.549">In</span> <span begin="2:11.549" end="2:12.248">si</span><span begin="2:12.248" end="2:12.534">lent</span> <span begin="2:12.534" end="2:13.113">mo</span><span begin="2:13.113" end="2:13.844">ments</span> <span begin="2:14.077" end="2:14.510">ima</span><span begin="2:14.510" end="2:14.785">gine</span> <span begin="2:14.785" end="2:15.124">you</span> <span begin="2:15.124" end="2:15.747">near</span> <span begin="2:15.747" end="2:16.397">here</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在寂静时刻 幻想你就在我身边</span></p><p begin="2:16.784" end="2:21.524" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:16.784" end="2:17.079">All</span> <span begin="2:17.079" end="2:17.435